timestamp=2026-11-04T12:05:04.026Z level=INFO run=282380a7 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\nimport csv\nfrom collections import defaultdict\n\nwith open('/app/dataset/hospital_compensation_registry.csv') as f:\n    reader = csv.DictReader(f)\n    rows = list(reader)\n\n# Build who lists whom\n# For each patient, see their contact. For each contact, see who lists them.\n# Also look at the other death cases\n\n# Case 2: PAT_265 has family support adjustment, contact PAT_065. PAT_065 is emergency contact for PAT_178 and PAT_146 also? And also for PAT_265. PAT_065 themselves have no claims.\n# Who are PAT_178, PAT_146?\ndeps = []\nfor r in rows:\n    if r['emergency_contact_patient_id'] == 'PAT_065':\n        deps.append(r['patient_id'])\nprint('Deps of PAT_065:', deps)\nfor pid in deps:\n    for r in rows:\n        if r['patient_id'] == pid:\n            print(f'  {pid}: has_claim={bool(r[\"compensation_reason\"])}, reason={r[\"compensation_reason\"]}, status={r[\"coverage_status\"]}')\n            break\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
